"DWARF Call Frame Information (CFI) describes how a consumer can virtually "
"*unwind* call frames in a running process or core dump. See DWARF Version 5 "
"section 6.4 and {ref}`amdgpu-dwarf-call-frame-information`."
msgstr ""

