msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:6341 ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:6531
msgid ""
"Maximum flat work-group size supported by the kernel in work-items. Must be "
">=1 and consistent with ReqdWorkGroupSize if not 0, 0, 0."
