#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:15416 ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:15452
msgid "If OpenCL and address space is not generic, omit `s_wait_dscnt 0x0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:13981 ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:14017
