"CDNA3 <amd-gcn-gfx942-cdna3>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX10-RDNA1 <amd-gcn-gfx10-"
"rdna1>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX10-RDNA2 <amd-gcn-gfx10-rdna2>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-"
"GFX11-RDNA3 <amd-gcn-gfx11-rdna3>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX11-RDNA3.5 <amd-gcn-"
